[node name="FreshTracks" type="Area2D" parent="Interactables"]
z_index = -8
position = Vector2(60, 0)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("10_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at the Mud"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]Tracks in the yard[/b]

The mud by the loading door is churned. Two sets of boots: one heavy and hobnailed, one a townsman's soft sole that turned in nervous circles. A cart has stood here, wheels sunk deep under a heavy load, and a horse was tied to the millstone.

Not a farmer's visit. Somebody comes here to meet somebody, by dark."
reexamine_text = "Hobnails, a townsman's soft soles, and a heavily loaded cart. A meeting place."

[node name="CollisionShape2D" type="CollisionShape2D" parent="Interactables/FreshTracks"]
shape = SubResource("RectangleShape2D_104x74")

