[node name="ShutteredLantern" type="Area2D" parent="Interactables"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(110, -60)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("10_story_item")
interaction_name = "Examine the Lantern"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]A shuttered lantern[/b]

Wedged in a gap in the mill wall, out of sight of the road: a dark-lantern with a sliding shutter, its candle half burned and the wax still soft. Three scratches on the stone beside it, like a count of signals.

Light it, close it, light it again. A message for someone watching from the trees."
reexamine_text = "The lantern's wax is still soft. Someone signals from here."

