[node name="OilyCloth" type="Area2D" parent="Interactables"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-45, -10)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("10_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at the Wrappings"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]Oiled wrappings[/b]

Torn from a bundle and left behind the crates: long strips of oilcloth, the kind used to keep blades from rusting on the road. They smell of quench oil and forge soot. The length of each strip is just about the length of a sword.

There is only one forge in Thornhaven."
reexamine_text = "Sword-length oilcloth that smells of the forge."

